    "cwc_collection_seo": {
      "type": "CWC_collection_seo",
      "blocks": {
        "cwc_collection_seo_b1": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "size": "large",
            "title": "Buying From Estates Liquor",
            "text": "<p>Estates Liquor is a licensed retailer operating a physical store in Coronado, California. Every bottle listed here is in stock and ships from our shelf, not from a third-party warehouse or a drop-shipping partner.</p>"
          }
        },
        "cwc_collection_seo_b2": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "size": "medium",
            "title": "How We Price",
            "text": "<p>Allocated and hard-to-find bottles are listed at fair retail the day they land. No lottery, no waitlist to buy in, and no inflated secondary-market pricing. When a bottle sells out we take it down rather than leaving it listed at a markup</p>"
          }
        },
        "cwc_collection_seo_b3": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "size": "medium",
            "title": "Sourcing and Authenticity",
            "text": "<p>Everything we carry comes through licensed distribution channels and is inspected before it ships. We do not buy from the secondary market or resell bottles of unverified origin.</p><p></p>"
          }
        },
        "cwc_collection_seo_b4": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "size": "medium",
            "title": "Packing and Shipping",
            "text": "<p>Every order is wrapped, braced, and boxed in molded inserts built for glass — the same packing whether it is a $35 bottle or a $2,000 one. Orders placed Monday through Thursday ship the same week. Someone 21 or older must be present to sign on delivery. We ship to most US states; enter your ZIP at checkout to confirm delivery to your address.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_J6KmyV": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "size": "small",
            "title": "Questions",
            "text": "<p>Our team is in the store six days a week. Call 619-791-3613 or email <a href=\"mailto:support@estatesliquor.com\">support@estatesliquor.com</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
